{"title":"广东省厅：5月15日起，对全省在建工地开展专项整治！","date":"2024-05-10","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">广东省厅：<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>日起，对全省在建工地开展专项整治！<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">5</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">9</span>日，广东省住建厅发布《关于开展<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年在建房屋市政工程建筑市场违法违规行为专项整治行动的通知》（粤建市函〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">242</span>号）。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">自<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span>日起至<span lang=\"EN-US\">11</span>月底止，开展<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年全省在建房屋市政工程建筑市场违法违规行为专项整治行动。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">整治范围：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">专项整治行动的范围是全省在建房屋市政工程，重点是涉投诉举报工程项目，重点工程、重大项目、涉水工程、涉隧道工程、超限高层建筑工程项目，其他规模较大以及安全生产和欠薪、欠款风险较高工程项目。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">整治内容：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">整治的主要内容如下：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">1</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">、违规履职执业行为：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">违规更换项目负责人、注册执业人员签署有虚假记载等不合格的文件、不按规定签字盖执业章、允许他人以自己的名义从事执业活动、同时在两个或以上单位受聘或者执业等。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">2</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">、不符合资质标准行为：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">勘察、设计、施工、监理以及其他专业分包单位的注册人员数量不符合相应企业资质标准要求条件。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">3</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">、发承包违法行为<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">4</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">、违反基本建设程序行为<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">5</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">、不落实保障农民工工资支付制度行为<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">6</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">、违规结算支付工程款和收取保证金行为<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">行动安排：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">原则上，现场检查的项目比例不低于在建项目总数<span lang=\"EN-US\">20%</span>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">对重点整治项目，优先选择以现场检查方式开展建筑市场行为检查。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">各地级以上市有关主管部门要通过领导带队、组织交叉检查等方式，对县（市、区）进行督导检查。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0;line-height:normal\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">省住建厅将委托专业机构组成若干督导检查组分片区对全省各市项目进行抽查，并视情组织各市住房城乡建设主管部门交叉参与。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}